<title>USA: Chesapeake shareholders approve split.</title>
<headline>Chesapeake shareholders approve split.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chesapeake Energy Corp said its proposed two-for-one common stock split was approved by shareholders at its annual meeting on December 13.</p>
<p>It said the split will become effective December 31. Chesapeake will begin trading at the split-adjusted price on January 2.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
